  "Description": {
    "Cost": 4358489,
    "UIName": "Pit Viper",
    "Id": "chassisdef_pit_viper_PV-Prime",
    "Name": "Pit Viper",
    "Details": "The Pit Viper Prime configuration carries an ER Large Laser in each arm backed by an LRM-15 in the left torso, delivering sustained long-range fire that remains potent as the target closes. This balance of precision energy and missile fire makes the Pit Viper Prime a versatile skirmisher capable of engaging multiple threats across extended distances.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Targeting - Short</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.01</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#0064e6>Used with permission from Aries Games and Miniatures.</color></b>",
