  "StockRole": "Brawler",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Pit Viper is Clan Star Adder’s answer to the fast strike OmniMech role. Capable of exceeding 110 kph and mounting 13.5 tons of pod space, it delivers serious firepower while maintaining high speed and armor. Though it lacks jump jets - limiting its effectiveness in tight terrain - its durability and energy-heavy loadouts make it an ideal scout and flanker in open environments. While some variants struggle with heat and ammo dependence, modular configurations help mitigate these issues, making the Pit Viper a reliable battlefield presence.",
